{"c":[{"name":"20261017T143616Z-2bbea48021b44381","text":"sr-initialize Step 2 now reads ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR} and ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA} from a quoted heredoc (IFS= read -r), so the shell never parses the pasted paths and no env var stands in; a value still starting with $ was not substituted. Supersedes the SKILL_DIR=\"...\" note.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261018T171632Z-1ff8e252c90ac5da","text":"Every path stockroom writes into shell text is quoted: Step 2 heredoc, shim and scheduler entries via shlex.quote, Makefile recipes via double quotes. A space or ' must work; rarer chars ($, backtick, \", \\, %) are out of scope (2026-10-18).","type":"note"}]}
